{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1150066-give-me-you-balor-deformities","id":1150066,"title":"Give me you Balor deformities!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-15T21:44:55-07:00","id":1150066,"title":"Give me you Balor deformities!","content":"Going to be starting a chronicle set in a newly minted Balor Barony, and I need some neat deformities for the members of the household.<br /> <br /> So far I have the Baron has a creepy bright eye like some sort of poisonous jungle frog.<br /> <br /> One of the lady courtiers has her arm gnarled into a emaciated claw<br /> and<br /> <br /> a sidhe knight where the left side of his face has a unworked stony texture to it.<br /> <br /> <br /> I could sure use some more though, so let me have it!<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3670-spook359","name":"Spook359","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3670_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-15T22:08:34-07:00","id":1150070,"title":"","content":"A Sidhe Princess with a forked black tongue and a voice that reverberates with a secondary raspy voice that seems just slightly out of sync with her words.<br /> <br /> A Duke with far too long scaled fingers that end in eagle talons.<br /> <br /> One of many Ladies in waiting, she is distinguished by a Hollowed out back that is filled with cobwebs and bio-luminescent fungi.<br /> <br /> a young pale Lord who seems off, his Eyes are large, black, and Almond Shape and a nose and mouth that are disturbingly small on his face.<br /> <br /> a Courtier who seems lovely and relatively normal, the back of her head however has an obscene maw which utters dark threats and impossible secrets.<br /> <br /> a Knight without eyes, In empty Sockets plays out Gruesome Battles in endless refrain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","name":"Jane_Dargason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3239_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T08:46:38-07:00","id":1150366,"title":"","content":"A pale Lady with eyes of liquid Darkness that runs down her perfect face in black streaks.<br /> <br /> Lord with cut veins instead of hair bloody and bleeding down his back.<br /> <br /> A knight with a reptilian arm covered in scales so deep red as to almost appear black.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T12:10:45-07:00","id":1150411,"title":"","content":"That's some creative stuff!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5211-firkraag","name":"Firkraag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5211_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"381"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-17T14:08:42-07:00","id":1150464,"title":"","content":"The lady with one half of her face an ideal of beauty and the other (typically covered with her hair among mortals but with a half-mask when among fey) disfigured, either with massive scars, a lack of skin or even nothing but bone. <br /> <br /> A handsome young man with shark teeth. (Pooka/Beastie?)<br /> <br /> A seer with no eyes.<br /> <br /> Serpents for hair?<br /> <br /> A body covered in scars (or tattoos) that spell out tails of blasphemy and madness. (And which change from time to time.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T10:41:30-07:00","id":1150695,"title":"","content":"Lady with a perfect skin except for the cracks spreading through her left shoulder reaching the left side of her face and revealing her to be an empty void inside a porcelain shell.<br /> <br /> A young knight with bony spurs extending from shoulders and head, skin bloody where it is pierced.<br /> <br /> A Balor Lord of seeming perfection, whose voice is a hollow whisper that makes one shiver throughoutly and almost hear him more through the resonace of ones shivering bones than transmitted through the air.<br /> <br /> A commoner knight of Balor who has mutilated the right side of her face with cold iron blades, leaving terrible scars and blurring her right eye milky white.<br /> <br /> Nocker knight of Balor who has had his hand burned and blackened by the fires of his forge, leaving it resembling a black charred claw more than a hand.<br /> <br /> Lady of Balorian descent whose eyes glow the purest white and show all who look deeply into them a vision of snowy fields littered with humanoid figures frozen solid amidst some great battle. All who have seen the vision are filled with a sense of peace quickly replaced by the horrible realization of the approach of the eternal winter.<br /> <br /> A Sidhe of perfect beauty aside from having heterochromia, which only makes him seem even more exotic. Except that everytime you see him at the periphery of your vision you could swear to have seen something crawl out of his eyesockets but when you turn to look everything is as it should be, aside from the fact that the green eye was the left one last time you looked not the right...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1629-possessed","name":"Possessed","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1629_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1140"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-20T14:20:10-07:00","id":1151474,"title":"","content":"A Mute Balor Assassin/theif who 'speaks' in index cards with things written on them... that may are may not be sprinkled with Iron filings","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/324-ardenty","name":"ardenty","avatar":"https://forum.theo